--------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY DATA
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/sukkur_june2025_climate.npz is derived from the NASA Prediction of
Worldwide Energy Resources (POWER) MERRA-2 hourly product, obtained from
https://power.larc.nasa.gov. NASA POWER data are freely available and are
redistributed here for reproducibility. Users should cite NASA POWER
directly in addition to this repository.
